            "feedback": {
              "evidence": [
                {
                  "type": "terminal",
                  "title": "Wrong kind",
                  "text": "$ kubectl -n ledger scale deploy cash --replicas=1\nError from server (NotFound): deployments.apps \"cash\" not found"
                }
              ],
              "teach": "Habit reached for Deployment before evidence named the kind. The instinct — scale the owner — is exactly right; the noun is a guess. One <code>kubectl get all</code> would have told you. In an exam a NotFound costs thirty seconds; in a cluster with a real Deployment of the same name it would scale the wrong workload."
            }
