              "teach": "Two flags, two different needs. <code>--show-labels</code> gives you the exact selector values — note that <code>orders-db</code> is an <code>app=</code> label here, not a name you can resolve, which is why the question says so explicitly. <code>-o wide</code> gives you the Pod IPs, which is what you will probe, because that is what the grader probes. Notice the <code>tier=data</code> label the two databases share: a tempting shortcut that would also let through anything else labelled data."
