              "teach": "A NetworkPolicy never sees a Service. Kube-proxy or the CNI rewrites the destination to a Pod IP before the policy is evaluated, so egress rules select the backing Pods by label and the Service name plays no part. Worse for you here, reaching a Service name needs DNS, which this policy is about to block — so a probe by name would fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the rule you wrote."
